  "description": "Kurohe – A Bold Display Font with Japanese and Graffiti Influence\nKurohe is a striking and unconventional display font that fuses the edgy energy of graffiti with the refined influence of Japanese design. Its bold strokes and distinctive character shapes make it an ideal choice for projects that demand presence and originality. Whether you’re crafting logos, branding materials, posters, or streetwear graphics, Kurohe adds a fearless, creative edge.\nThis font is 100% free for both personal and commercial use. Attribution is not required, though credit is always appreciated if you’d like to support the artist.",
